<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 16.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 16.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day (upto 0700 GMT) and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at 0700 GMT was 2939.63, 58.08 points or 2.02</p>
<p>percent higher than Friday's close.</p>
